# SoyaOS — local environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and source it before running `./bin/soyaos start`,
# or export the variables in your shell profile. `.env` itself is gitignored.
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL — soyaos boots with zero env config:
#   - persistence: embedded bbolt at $XDG_DATA_HOME/soyaos/soyaos.bolt
#                  (no MySQL / Postgres / SQLite — bolt IS the local store)
#   - cache:       in-process (no Redis / Memcached)
#   - LLM:         echo agent only until SOYA_MODEL_API_KEY is set
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Upstream LLM (BYOK — Bring Your Own Key)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Three-tuple that points pkg/llmcall at any OpenAI-Compatible endpoint:
# OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, DeepSeek, Moonshot, Groq, Together, Fireworks,
# Ollama (`http://localhost:11434/v1`), vLLM, LM Studio, …
#
# Setting SOYA_MODEL_API_KEY is enough to enable BYOK — the base URL and
# default model fall back to OpenAI's public endpoint + gpt-4o-mini. With
# the key set, `soyaos start` additionally registers a `soya:llm` Agent
# that proxies the configured upstream end-to-end.
#
# v0.1.0-alpha.1 will let SoyaPack manifests override these per-Agent via
# a `prompt.upstream` segment; until then the env tuple is the source of
# truth.

# SOYA_MODEL_API_KEY=sk-...
# SOYA_MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# SOYA_MODEL_DEFAULT=gpt-4o-mini

# Common alternatives (uncomment one block):
#
#   # DeepSeek
#   # SOYA_MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
#   # SOYA_MODEL_DEFAULT=deepseek-chat
#
#   # Moonshot / Kimi
#   # SOYA_MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.moonshot.cn/v1
#   # SOYA_MODEL_DEFAULT=moonshot-v1-8k
#
#   # Local Ollama (no API key needed; SOYA_MODEL_API_KEY can be any non-empty string)
#   # SOYA_MODEL_API_KEY=ollama
#   # SOYA_MODEL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
#   # SOYA_MODEL_DEFAULT=qwen2.5:7b-instruct
#
#   # Anthropic via its OpenAI-Compat endpoint
#   # SOYA_MODEL_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com/v1
#   # SOYA_MODEL_DEFAULT=claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Persistence root
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# soyaos.bolt lives at $XDG_DATA_HOME/soyaos/. If XDG_DATA_HOME is unset the
# default is $HOME/.local/share/soyaos. You can also override per-invocation
# with `soyaos start --data-dir /path/to/dir` which takes precedence.
#
# XDG_DATA_HOME=/Users/you/.local/share

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chrome binary (only needed for PDF / long_image artifact renderers)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# pkg/artifact/{pdf,long_image}_renderer auto-detect Chrome / Chromium in PATH
# and the common macOS install hints. Set this to override with an absolute
# path if you have a non-standard install (e.g. headless Chromium for tests).
# Not needed for HTML / xlsx / mp4 renderers or for echo agent.
#
# SOYAOS_CHROME=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLI flags (NOT env vars — listed here for completeness)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# soyaos start \
#   --listen 127.0.0.1:7474   # OpenAI-Compat gateway (data plane)
#   --rpc    127.0.0.1:7475   # control RPC (loopback only)
#   --data-dir DIR            # overrides $XDG_DATA_HOME/soyaos
